name walk-false-knight-from-bench-47
title from the bench save in Crossroads_47 through the False Knight and the City Crest (a game continued from a card)
max_ticks 90000
# The fast loop of the fight: a card taken at the bench in Crossroads_47 (the walk of the whole run with a `snapshot` there), the
# way back out to the arena, the fight and the Crest. Same fragments as new-game-to-crest.walk from the bench on.
include continue-47.walk
include crossroads-47b.walk
include crossroads-03b.walk
include crossroads-21.walk
include crossroads-10.walk
include false-knight.walk
include city-crest.walk
check end HK_FK_DEATHS == 1 ; HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0 ; HK_FK_STAGGERS == 3 ; HK_FK_CONVERSIONS == 3 ; HK_PICKUPS_TAKEN == 1 ; HK_HEALTH >= 1
